Hold a host light/dark transition back from panes until the host's new
default colours have reached the server.

Upstream: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr/issues/4183 (the Linux "OSC 11
stale by one flip" comment is this bug). Drop this patch once that issue is
closed and the fix ships in the herdr version nixpkgs-unstable carries.

Local patch only: herdr closes unsolicited PRs from non-approved
contributors, and its bug template forbids attaching patches.

